# Integrity hashes in registry.json are computed over the committed bytes of
# these files. A checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF, so
# every hash verification false-fails. Pin them to LF so any checkout hashes
# identically to what CI verified.
servers/**/manifest.json text eol=lf
servers/**/setup.sh text eol=lf
# Not present yet, but setupScriptWindowsSha256 covers these bytes the same way.
servers/**/*.ps1 text eol=lf
registry.json text eol=lf
